{"id":"romo","lemma":"romo","pos":"adj","rank":1239,"glosses":["blunt, dull","snub"],"ipa":"/ˈromo/","forms":{"feminine":"roma","masculinePlural":"romos","femininePlural":"romas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ef/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-romo.wav","examples":[{"text":"El cuchillo está romo.","en":"The knife is dull.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448627"},{"text":"Roma queda en Italia.","en":"Rome is in Italy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443011"},{"text":"El cuchillo era tan romo no pude usarlo para cortar la carne, así que tuve que depender de mi navaja de bolsillo.","en":"That knife was so blunt I couldn't use it to cut the meat so I had to rely on my pocket knife."},{"text":"Roma está en Italia.","en":"Rome is in Italy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443040"},{"text":"He ido a Roma.","en":"I have been to Rome.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449964"}]}